# Special Issue on Graph Algorithms

**Authors:** Jesper Jansson

## Abstract
<jats:p>This special issue of Algorithms is devoted to the design and analysis of algorithms for solving combinatorial problems of a theoretical or practical nature involving graphs, with a focus on computational complexity.</jats:p>

